      en: ["Frauenfeld Castle was constructed around the year 1227.", "From 1712 to 1798, Frauenfeld served as the seat of the Swiss Federal Diet.", "Openair Frauenfeld attracts over 150,000 visitors each year.", "The town officially received city rights in the year 1245.", "Frauenfeld is home to the Museum of Archaeology of the Canton of Thurgau.", "The confluence of the Murg and Thur rivers is located just a few kilometers north of the city."],
