      en: ["Aarau served as the first capital of Switzerland for six months in 1798.", "The city is famous for over 70 painted eaves dating from the late Gothic and Renaissance periods.", "The cantonal capital is situated at an elevation of 384 meters above sea level.", "The Aargauer Kunsthaus opened in 1959 and was expanded in 2003 by Herzog & de Meuron.", "The Stadtkirche (city church) was constructed between 1471 and 1478 in late Gothic style.", "Aarau is a vital railway hub with direct SBB connections to all major Swiss cities."],
