      en: ["Sarnen is the capital of Obwalden with a population of about 10,000.", "The White Book of Sarnen from 1470 is stored in the town hall archives.", "The Hexenturm on Landenberg hill dates back to the 13th century.", "The town is situated at an elevation of 473 meters above sea level.", "A major fire in 1468 destroyed nearly the entire settlement.", "Landenberg hill was the site of the open-air assembly (Landsgemeinde) for centuries."],
