      en: ["Appenzell is the capital of Switzerland's smallest canton by population.", "The Landsgemeinde assembly is held annually on the last Sunday of April.", "The main street is famous for its richly decorated wooden houses.", "The village is located at an altitude of 780 meters above sea level.", "The Museum Appenzell in the town hall showcases local history and folklore.", "The Säntis peak, at 2,502 meters, is the highest mountain in the region."],
