      en: ["Glacier 3000 at 2971 m above sea level is the highest point in the ski area.", "The Gstaad Palace Hotel was opened in December 1913.", "The Menuhin Festival has been held annually since its founding in 1957.", "The village center of Gstaad has been a car-free zone since 1998.", "The Gstaad Mountain Rides ski area includes around 200 kilometers of slopes.", "The Saanenmöser pass is located at 1279 m above sea level on the watershed."],
      es: ["Gstaad se encuentra a 1.044 m s. n. m.", "La estación de esquí Gstaad-Mountain Ride abarca 220 km de pistas.", "El municipio de Saanen tiene 6.800 habitantes.", "El distrito de Gstaad tiene unos 1.000 habitantes.", "El Gstaad Menuhin Festival fue fundado en 1957.", "La elevación más alta en la estación de esquí es el Glacier 3000 (3.000 m)."],
      pt: ["Gstaad situa-se a 1.044 m acima do nível do mar.", "A estação de esqui Gstaad-Mountain Ride abrange 220 km de pistas.", "O município de Saanen tem 6.800 habitantes.", "O distrito de Gstaad tem cerca de 1.000 habitantes.", "O Gstaad Menuhin Festival foi fundado em 1957.", "A elevação mais alta na estação de esqui é o Glacier 3000 (3.000 m)."],
      fr: ["Gstaad se situe à 1 044 m d'altitude.", "Le domaine skiable Gstaad-Mountain Ride comprend 220 km de pistes.", "La commune de Saanen compte 6 800 habitants.", "Le quartier de Gstaad compte environ 1 000 habitants.", "Le Gstaad Menuhin Festival a été fondé en 1957.", "Le point culminant du domaine skiable est le Glacier 3000 (3 000 m)."],
