      en: ["The decisive Battle of Murten took place on June 22, 1476.", "Lake Murten is situated at an altitude of 429 m above sea level.", "The medieval town wall has a circumference of around 1000 meters.", "Murten was founded around the year 1170 by Duke Berchtold IV.", "The Murten Run covers a distance of exactly 17.17 kilometers.", "Lake Murten reaches a maximum depth of 45 meters at its deepest point."],
