      hu: ["A pompaples-i vízválasztó 495 méteres magasságban található.", "A Saint-Loup kórházat 1852-ben alapították.", "A víz szétválasztása egy mesterséges gátnál történik.", "A Pompaples-en keresztülfolyó patak neve Nozon.", "A Saint-Loup uradalom 1324 óta történelmileg dokumentált.", "A pompaples-i kastély a 17. században épült."],
      ro: ["Cumpăna apelor din Pompaples se află la 495 m altitudine.", "Spitalul Saint-Loup a fost fondat în anul 1852.", "Divizarea apei are loc la un stăvilă artificială.", "Pârâul care curge prin Pompaples se numește Nozon.", "Senioria Saint-Loup este documentată istoric din 1324.", "Castelul Pompaples a fost construit în secolul al XVII-lea."],
      en: ["The watershed in Pompaples is at 495 m above sea level.", "The Saint-Loup Hospital was founded in the year 1852.", "The division of the water takes place at an artificial weir.", "The brook flowing through Pompaples is called the Nozon.", "The Lordship of Saint-Loup has been historically documented since 1324.", "The Pompaples Castle was built in the 17th century."],
