      en: ["Grandson Castle was presumably founded in the 11th century.", "In the battle of 1476, the Confederates captured a legendary Burgundian treasure.", "The Church of Saint-Jean-Baptiste contains 12 ancient Roman columns in its nave.", "Grandson was officially reformed in 1554 after coming under Bernese influence.", "The municipality is located at an elevation of 447 meters above sea level.", "The town fortifications were once directly linked to the castle by walls."],
